<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35321" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδῠτ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					1028
				</span></i>
			 codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					257
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδυτόν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσθημα</span>). τό, <i>garment,
				dress,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				179.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				8.65
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ, νεβρίδων</span>
			<i>a dress</i> of fawn-skin, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				111
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				138
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλων ἐνδυτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IA</u>
					1073
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σαρκός</span>
			the skin, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				746
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὐνδυτὸν τῆς κοιλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					98.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clad in, covered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέμμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					224
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
